      <title>peazip/PeaZip</title>
      <link>https://github.com/peazip/PeaZip</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Free Zip / Unzip software and Rar file extractor. Cross-platform file and archive manager. Features volume spanning, compression, authenticated encryption. Supports 7Z, 7-Zip sfx, ACE, ARJ, Brotli, BZ2, CAB, CHM, CPIO, DEB, GZ, ISO, JAR, LHA/LZH, NSIS, OOo, PAQ/LPAQ, PEA, QUAD, RAR, RPM, split, TAR, Z, ZIP, ZIPX, Zstandard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;link&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peazip.github.io&quot;&gt;https://peazip.github.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;</description>
      
